@startuml feature-settings-page
title Settings Page Feature Flow

' Status: Planned

actor User
participant "Settings Page" as SettingsPage
participant "Settings Sections" as SettingsSections

User -> SettingsPage: Open settings page
SettingsPage --> User: Show general application settings

User -> SettingsSections: Review available preferences

alt User changes a setting
  User -> SettingsSections: Update one or more settings
  SettingsSections --> User: Show changed values and save action
  User -> SettingsSections: Save settings
  SettingsSections --> User: Confirm saved settings
else User only reviews settings
  SettingsSections --> User: Keep current settings unchanged
end

@enduml